keywords:
  - integrity
  - evidence
  - agent
  - verification
  - provenance
  - protocol
notes: >-
  Written in Internet-Draft shape so reviewers can read it the way they read a
  draft. It has not been submitted to any standards body, carries no IETF
  copyright notice, and must not be cited as an Internet-Draft.
